# FastH3 t2v, BF16 QK^T + E4M3 PV attention on the fused path (h3fast/vsa_fp8.cuh).
# Measured 2026-11-07, production: 11.98 -> 11.06 s per 5 s 1344x768 clip; teacher-forced velocity error vs BF16
# 0.194 -> 0.196 (video), 0.071 -> 0.074 (audio). Omni already runs this mode by default.
#   docker compose --env-file profiles/fast.env up -d t2v
FASTVIDEO_H3_FP8_ATTN=pv
# Long prompts (>= 2048 prefix rows): the text prefix runs dense on FlashAttention-4 in BF16 (10K-token prompt 20.6 -> 19.3 s).
T2V_DENSE_PREFIX=bf16
T2V_DENSE_PREFIX_MIN_ROWS=2048
